   "text": "Tests: 17 Forge tests (532/532 pass)  |  cast-derived EIP-712 vector in Rust  |  authorizer unit tests (webhook approve / refuse / unreachable, TTL bounds)\nzone-node e2e: unlisted account -> zone_authorizeDeposit -> depositAuthorized on real T13 portal -> zone mint -> replay rejected\nnegative control: authorizer signing with the wrong chain ID makes the e2e fail (UnauthorizedDepositAuthorizer)",
   "originalText": "Tests: 17 Forge tests (532/532 pass)  |  cast-derived EIP-712 vector in Rust  |  authorizer unit tests (webhook approve / refuse / unreachable, TTL bounds)\nzone-node e2e: unlisted account -> zone_authorizeDeposit -> depositAuthorized on real T13 portal -> zone mint -> replay rejected\nnegative control: authorizer signing with the wrong chain ID makes the e2e fail (UnauthorizedDepositAuthorizer)",
